---
title: A practical start on the EU AI Act
summary: Classification, evidence gaps, and remediation sequencing for teams that cannot pause the roadmap.
publishedAt: 2026-04-02
author: KaleidoSpark
---

The EU AI Act rewards organisations that already know their AI estate. Panic inventories help less than a calm, owned classification exercise.

## Classify with your risk forum

Bring legal, risk, and product owners into the same room. Map systems to risk tiers using your existing decision forums where possible—do not invent parallel bureaucracy on day one.

## Evidence before slogans

Transparency statements and technical documentation only matter if they match the deployed system. Close the gap between slideware and production logs first.
